  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.8). This is the V1 revision (SH8601 panel, FT3168 touch), discontinued; boards shipped from 30 May 2026 are V2 (CO5300, CST820, 16-column offset) on the same pins and need the -v2 record - check the label on the back. Every pin recorded here is the same in the vendor's code and on the schematic; the disagreements are inside the vendor's code. The glass has rounded corners whose radius Waveshare does not give, so the designer draws them square: keep what matters out of the corners, or set a corner radius on the Display tab once it is measured. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
